/E (I am an IT undergraduate specializing in Artificial Intelligence with a strong passion for becoming an AI Engineer and building intelligent technologies that solve real-world problems. I am currently focused on Generative AI, machine learning, computer vision, RAG systems, and full-stack development while continuously improving my skills through hands-on projects and modern software engineering practices. I have also developed agentic AI projects using multi-agent architectures and orchestration frameworks for intelligent workflow automation and context-aware decision-making. I enjoy developing scalable AI-powered systems and continuously exploring emerging technologies in AI and software engineering.)
