/E (Developed a Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) document question-answering system that enables users to upload PDFs and receive accurate, context-aware answers. Built with FastAPI, LangGraph, OpenAI GPT-4o, and Pinecone, the solution uses a multi-agent pipeline for query planning, document retrieval, answer generation, and verification, ensuring reliable and grounded responses with scalable serverless deployment.)
